---
title: Blob Transaction Validation (Osaka Exceptions)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> q_init : start
    q_init --> q_blob_check : validate blob transaction fields
    q_blob_check --> q_blob_fee : has blob data
    q_blob_check --> q_err_no_blob : no blob data
    q_err_no_blob --> [*] : raise NoBlobDataError

    q_blob_fee --> q_blob_count : max_fee_per_blob_gas >= blob_base_fee
    q_blob_fee --> q_err_blob_fee : max_fee_per_blob_gas < blob_base_fee
    q_err_blob_fee --> [*] : raise InsufficientMaxFeePerBlobGasError

    q_blob_count --> q_blob_gas : blob_count <= max_blobs
    q_blob_count --> q_err_blob_count : blob_count > max_blobs
    q_err_blob_count --> [*] : raise BlobCountExceededError

    q_blob_gas --> q_version_check : blob_gas <= blob_gas_limit
    q_blob_gas --> q_err_blob_gas : blob_gas > blob_gas_limit
    q_err_blob_gas --> [*] : raise BlobGasLimitExceededError

    q_version_check --> q_valid : all versioned hashes valid
    q_version_check --> q_err_version : invalid versioned hash found
    q_err_version --> [*] : raise InvalidBlobVersionedHashError

    q_valid --> [*] : blob transaction accepted

    note right of q_blob_check
        INV-012: Blob validation only for
        blob-carrying tx types (EIP-4844)
    end note

    note right of q_valid
        INV-013: All blob exceptions extend InvalidTransaction
        INV-014: Blob count and gas checks are independent but ordered
        INV-015: Versioned hash validation checks each commitment
    end note
